<h1>4. Company Structure</h1>
<h2>Chartvolt Ltd (Cyprus)</h2>
<p>Owns IP. Operates Chartvolt.com. All B2C, marketplace, competitions, GM program. 12.5% tax. EU passporting.</p>
<h2>Chartvolt Solutions Ltd (Estonia)</h2>
<p>White-label B2B licensing. 0% tax on reinvested profits. E-residency.</p>
