<!-- PART IV -->
<div class="section-divider"><div class="part-title">Part IV</div><div class="part-subtitle">Investor Presentation</div></div>

<h1>31. Pitch Deck</h1>

<h2>Slide 1: CHARTVOLT</h2>
<p style="font-size:16pt;color:#0f3460;text-align:center;"><strong>Gamified Trading Infrastructure</strong></p>
<p style="text-align:center;">Seed Round: &euro;300,000</p>

<h2>Slide 2: The Problem</h2>
<p>70% trader churn in 90 days. &euro;200&ndash;800 CAC. Identical platforms. No retention.</p>

<h2>Slide 3: The Solution</h2>
<p>Gamification + competitions + progression on professional trading tools. White-label for brokers. <strong>Game Master network</strong> for self-funded user acquisition.</p>

<h2>Slide 4: Market</h2>
<p>USD 10B+ market. 3,000+ brokers. 500+ prop firms. 15M+ traders. Thousands of educators. No full-stack competitor.</p>

<h2>Slide 5: Product</h2>
<p>106 indicators. 169+ milestones. 266+ badges. Competitions. Challenges. AI marketplace. White-label. 4-tier Game Master system.</p>

<h2>Slide 6: Revenue Model</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Stream</th><th>Model</th><th>Margin</th></tr>
  <tr><td>White-Label</td><td>&euro;6K/mo + &euro;10K setup</td><td>~85%</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Competitions</td><td>30% rake</td><td>~88%</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Game Master</strong></td><td><strong>&euro;100&ndash;1,000/mo</strong></td><td><strong>~80%</strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Subscriptions</td><td>&euro;29/mo</td><td>~90%</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Challenges + Marketplace</td><td>30% rake / commission</td><td>~90%</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Slide 7: The Game Master Flywheel</h2>
<p>GM pays &euro;100&ndash;1,000/month. Recruits users (referral code). Users enter competitions. Platform earns 30%. GM earns 2&ndash;15% from platform cut. <strong>Year 3: 120 GMs = &euro;423K direct + 500 users at &euro;0 CAC.</strong></p>

<h2>Slide 8: Traction</h2>
<p>MVP complete. Full platform ready for launch.</p>

<h2>Slide 9: Year 1</h2>
<p><strong>&euro;560K revenue | &euro;438K costs | &euro;122K profit (21.8% margin)</strong><br>
6 people. &euro;8K/mo marketing. 25 GMs. 500 users. 2 WL clients.</p>

<h2>Slide 10: 3-Year Projections</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th></th><th>Year 1</th><th>Year 2</th><th>Year 3</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Users / GMs / WL</td><td>500 / 25 / 2</td><td>1,000 / 60 / 5</td><td>2,000 / 120 / 8</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Revenue</td><td>&euro;560K</td><td>&euro;1,135K</td><td>&euro;2,040K</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Profit</td><td>&euro;122K</td><td>&euro;562K</td><td>&euro;1,340K</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Margin</td><td>22%</td><td>50%</td><td>66%</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Cumulative: &euro;2,024,000 | Y3 Cash: &euro;2,075,000</p>

<h2>Slide 11: Unit Economics</h2>
<p>LTV:CAC (organic) 10.5x. GM-referred CAC: &euro;0. Revenue/employee: &euro;93K&rarr;&euro;204K.</p>

<h2>Slide 12: Team</h2>
<p>Y1: 6 (CEO, Sr Dev, Mid Dev, Platform Mgr, Compliance, CS). Y2: 8. Y3: 10. Lean, remote.</p>

<h2>Slide 13: The Ask</h2>
<p><strong>&euro;300,000 seed.</strong> Already profitable. Marketing 33%, Operations 27%, Infra 17%, Personnel 17%, Legal 7%.</p>

<h2>Slide 14: Exit and Returns</h2>
<p>Y3: <strong>&euro;16&ndash;24M</strong> (8&ndash;12x ARR). 20% equity = <strong>10.9&ndash;16.3x ROI</strong>. Cash: &euro;2.08M.</p>

